Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.03,0:00:08.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(75,75)}It's all right! Now let's move forward
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.37,0:00:11.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,with the sun always in our hearts
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.76,0:00:15.03,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,As power passes through our clasped hands
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.18,0:00:18.68,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's grab hold of our wishes{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.30,0:00:31.85,OP11 Credits,,50,0,230,,Translation\N FUNimation
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.32,0:00:32.51,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Working together, let's ride the giant waves{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.55,0:00:37.02,OP11 Credits,,450,0,280,,Soundtracking\NHalee
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.55,0:00:37.02,OP11 Credits,,0,450,350,,Infoboxes/Title Card\N BernieCrane
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.85,0:00:40.33,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,{\i1}Let's hurry toward the excitement--\Nthere's the starting signal{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.14,0:00:41.03,OP11 Credits,,0,100,420,,Editing\NFeeso
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.01,0:00:47.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now's the time to set sail-- let's raise anchor{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.51,0:00:47.12,OP11 Credits,,470,0,290,,Quality Checking\N Alasta\NGalaxy 9000\NMr. Luffy
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.99,0:00:55.00,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,{\i1}Cut through the rainbow-colored wind\Nand head for a sea of adventure{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.13,0:00:58.57,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It'll be a journey fraught with injury{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.65,0:01:02.30,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but what you cherish most will be right there{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.50,0:01:06.43,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And if you get into a jam{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.50,0:01:06.47,OP11 Credits,,0,30,410,,Timing\NGalaxy 9000
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.50,0:01:08.38,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll always be there to protect you{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.32,0:01:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, let's move on
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.53,0:01:13.36,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's all right! Now let's move forward{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.71,0:01:16.85,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}with the sun always in our hearts{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.52,0:01:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the night of the night,\Nthe clouds are coming
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.23,0:01:20.35,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,{\i1}If a storm hits, let's put\Nour arms around each other{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.40,0:01:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The clouds are coming, and\Nlook at the light of the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.46,0:01:24.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(75,0)}{\i1}and gaze at the light beyond{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.72,0:01:27.97,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we gather up the pieces of our dreams{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.42,0:01:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we see the moon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.33,0:01:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll see the moon We'll\Nsee the moon in the future
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.47,0:01:31.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}they'll make a map leading to tomorrow{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.24,0:01:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'll
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.73,0:01:34.75,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So let's grab hold of our wishes{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.16,0:01:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.22,0:01:40.48,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}under the same flag-- together, we're one{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.08,0:01:51.97,Title,,0,0,420,,{\fad(100,0)}Donut Race!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.82,0:01:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this time to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.73,0:01:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,explain how the race works.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The course consists of one lap\Naround Long Ring Long Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.32,0:02:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may sound easy, but\Nbelieve me, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.70,0:02:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If your boat sinks, your team is\Nimmediately disqualified from the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.80,0:02:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! Weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.18,0:02:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're allowed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.09,0:02:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guns, cannons, explosives,\Nanything you can think of!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.10,0:02:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that sounds unfair, then you've got no\Nright at all to call yourself a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.12,0:02:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Portia!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.60,0:02:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, drown that long\Nnose! Who, me? That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.26,0:02:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to win this now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.90,0:02:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drowning is fair play.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.28,0:02:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's in the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.19,0:02:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm excited about this! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now pay close attention, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.02,0:02:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything happens to those\Ntwo ladies, I'll eviscerate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.14,0:02:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are going to win this race.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.79,0:02:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, they think they\Nhave a chance of winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.20,0:02:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let the fools think whatever\Nthey want to think, Porcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll sink them right off the bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Monda?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.90,0:02:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.96,0:02:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.87,0:02:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He honestly thinks they're going to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.92,0:02:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a riot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's ever beat the Foxy Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.26,0:02:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt this race will\Neven last five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:02:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:02:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.60,0:03:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To ensure you don't get lost, we're\Nproviding each team with an eternal pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.76,0:03:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.28,0:03:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this doofus talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.42,0:03:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would we leave the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're taking the inside\Ntrack the whole way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it won't be that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, on your marks, Jeopardy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.56,0:03:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just tell me why it won't be simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.94,0:03:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a terrible feeling about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.68,0:03:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, quit babbling and tell us why already!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.18,0:03:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Push, push, push!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to reveal the secret of our book.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.68,0:03:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got a sneaky little burpee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.02,0:03:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't get far enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.38,0:03:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.56,0:03:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.12,0:03:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not me! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.04,0:04:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they've been released!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.65,0:04:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaboom!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.57,0:04:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The old barrel mines!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.48,0:04:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Coaster's Chump Card!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later, chumps!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to avoid\Nthinking, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wish us good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.02,0:04:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Capote, give them a\Ntaste of your fishman karate. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.80,0:04:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surface Splitter!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.10,0:04:28.82,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sea Surface Splitter!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boat's breaking apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our balance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to stay balanced!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this! Eat flame!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.01,0:04:41.93,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Special Attack: Flame Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.70,0:04:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right. Ocho Fleurs!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.35,0:04:45.81,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ocho Fleurs!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.35,0:04:45.81,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Eight Flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the? Capote!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.92,0:04:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, flip.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.48,0:04:51.62,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Flip!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect! Now's our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:04:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, jump in the\Nwater and pull the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.58,0:04:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.49,0:05:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaido, Monda, get it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.76,0:05:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, pedal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.06,0:05:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's about time that\Nwe get to work, Hamburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.99,0:05:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, I was hoping you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, folks,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.44,0:05:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,currently in the lead of the race is\Neveryone's all-time favorite, the Cutie Wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.82,0:05:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right behind them in second\Nplace is the Baratie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.76,0:05:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we just use one of your dials?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.36,0:05:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.58,0:05:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can give this breath dial a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were going faster before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.62,0:05:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, do you have a jet dial on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you know how rare those are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.40,0:05:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're talking about losing a crew member.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.53,0:05:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't lose here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just too much at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.90,0:05:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we lose, I know they'll\Ndefinitely take me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.42,0:05:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I so cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.48,0:05:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.39,0:05:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just keep on dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.18,0:05:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, this isn't the\Nbest time for reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.54,0:05:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm rowing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:05:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, your hands are, but\Nyou're not really focused on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.52,0:06:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to end up like me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.02,0:06:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am working hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, working hard in archaeology.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.84,0:06:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we head for the finish line,\Nor should we enjoy seeking them first?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.48,0:06:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I enjoy casually scrolling through the\Nfinish line as much as the next guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.08,0:06:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I want to make that chick suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simply winning this thing ain't\Ngoing to be enough for me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.12,0:06:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.74,0:06:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's this work for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.42,0:06:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent, Robert.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is downright cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.58,0:06:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.40,0:06:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too bad they already noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Capote, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're going to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.34,0:06:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just keep paddling with all we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.24,0:06:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to try and catch up to them\Nbefore they get an even bigger lead on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.52,0:06:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, I guess I'll be\Nseeking them after all. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.94,0:06:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.70,0:06:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're now approaching the most\Nfearsome obstacles of the course,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Long Coral Reef.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:06:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just beyond that\Nforeboding and difficult patch
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:07:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is the dreaded Long Ring\NWhirlpool of Long King.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.76,0:07:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can they overcome these hurdles?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And oh, we'll all be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.96,0:07:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.10,0:07:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Full Dash Hamburg at full speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And riding atop him is the\Nmaster of obstruction himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.26,0:07:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the scourge of fairness, and the\Ngreatest scoundrel of all time, our boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silver Fox Foxy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.66,0:07:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just come up with an evil idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.56,0:07:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This race is really heating up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next course obstacle, the\Nlong coral reef is dead ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.72,0:07:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leading the race is Portia\Nand the cutie wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.26,0:07:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, that weird reef is causing\Nsome unusual currents to form.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.84,0:07:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going in blind is not a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.52,0:07:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I can't believe this stupid\Nrace has lasted this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.42,0:07:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, Monda! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.92,0:07:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's someone on land looking for\Nevery opportunity to sabotage this race.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.80,0:07:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our boss, Silver Fox Foxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:08:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what does he have in store for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.52,0:08:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, hope you like fish and noodles,\Nfree of charge. For real? Oh, how cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.86,0:08:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.92,0:08:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it that all the good cooks\Nlike you were already taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.34,0:08:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your curly-cute eyebrows are so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.52,0:08:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I gotta say, I\Nwon't mind if I get Davy Back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we need another\Nround of drinks down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.94,0:08:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The brew is endless,\Nso drink all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.18,0:08:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, you guys are all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.72,0:08:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, get him, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.38,0:08:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.94,0:08:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Nami, keep\Nrowing. Not yet. Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.16,0:08:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're getting further ahead of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.57,0:08:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not going in yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Cutie Wagon takes\Nadvantage of this opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and plunges forward into\Nthe long coral reef!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.66,0:08:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Monda! Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.80,0:08:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute! What's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monda!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:08:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, they came back. What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Cutie Wagon has been\Npushed back out of the reef!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.18,0:09:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening down there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.56,0:09:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.32,0:09:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, I knew there was something\Nweird about those currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.82,0:09:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.78,0:09:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get moving, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.14,0:09:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.05,0:09:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's try this again, Monda!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.88,0:09:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.82,0:09:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there you have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.16,0:09:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The devilish interference\Nwe've all been waiting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.72,0:09:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of smokescreen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the reef will be far too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.02,0:09:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there you have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Operation Whiteout successful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.54,0:09:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see how you navigate through this\Nreef when you can't even see through it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sure it worked?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.94,0:09:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They made it through\Nwith no trouble at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.98,0:09:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.46,0:09:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I called it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.56,0:09:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the duty wagon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.74,0:10:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.84,0:10:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems they've been pushed back again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.94,0:10:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, the boat is moving on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is a maze\Nof currents. Currents?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.41,0:10:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That giant whirlpool\Nahead of us is causing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.72,0:10:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,smaller whirlpools to\Nform within the reef?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,resulting in these strange currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter if we can't\Nsee, their course won't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.84,0:10:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as we take the right entrance,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these currents will guide the\Nboat along all by themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.58,0:10:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.49,0:10:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.41,0:10:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you can do when you've got the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.58,0:10:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,best navigator on the\NGrand Line in your crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.78,0:10:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.90,0:10:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.10,0:10:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they won't be celebrating for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.62,0:10:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once they're out of the reef, they\Nhead straight into the long ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, stop freaking out\Nand use it. Use what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.42,0:10:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The impact dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.82,0:10:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't have it with me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, then what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.18,0:10:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.09,0:10:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're dead. How did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.78,0:10:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.90,0:10:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't use it soon, we'll be\Nsucked down into the giant whirlpool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.98,0:10:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what it's like to use that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.54,0:11:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're running out of time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.72,0:11:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why you've\Nbeen acting so calm, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.94,0:11:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had this plan from the\Nvery beginning, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.12,0:11:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.03,0:11:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Barrel Tiger picked\Nup some tremendous speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.74,0:11:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not just going\Nfaster, they're playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.16,0:11:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with that move, the Barrel\NTiger now has a commanding lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this mean defeat\Nfor the Beauty Wagon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.08,0:11:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were way too easy on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.10,0:11:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karoo, time!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.65,0:11:27.65,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Combine!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.19,0:11:30.66,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Two Fish Engine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.36,0:11:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two fish engines!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.06,0:11:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not out of the race yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By fusing fish man muscle\Nwith the fin of a shark,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.64,0:11:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the cutie wagon has\Ndoubled its engine speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're blazing through the\Ncoral and closing the gap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.54,0:11:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The race is now half over!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, the barrel tiger\Ndesperately paddles on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.26,0:11:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.72,0:11:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off and start paddling!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your arm seems to be\Nbending the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.18,0:11:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.48,0:11:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like a course marker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn right, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.62,0:12:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess we'll turn right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.86,0:12:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She broke it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our boss is Ploy Number 18.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.92,0:12:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Operation Life has failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.70,0:12:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a formidable woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does she not believe in\Nanything in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.64,0:12:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's fell mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.02,0:12:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too the race continues with the barrel\Ntiger maintaining its strong lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.78,0:12:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are these columns of water?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.00,0:12:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are now clearing the long\Nwaves that reach high into?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.42,0:12:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sky was that supposed to be natural?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.36,0:12:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.04,0:12:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh boss, I mean oh grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.78,0:12:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.72,0:12:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My time on this earth is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.32,0:12:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boss unleashes his third nasty trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.18,0:12:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dying granny over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.98,0:12:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't you stop and help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.02,0:12:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She completely ignores.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a child and his sick,\Nhelpless grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.76,0:12:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing she cares about\Nis getting what she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.16,0:13:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How cold-hearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.42,0:13:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Ice Queen Navigator Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.24,0:13:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to can it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.50,0:13:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never fall for a\Nridiculous trick like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.46,0:13:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I mention she was found out? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.10,0:13:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the finish line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This race will soon be decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.70,0:13:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not gonna be that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cutie wagon is closing in quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.94,0:13:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are the final moments of round one's
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.86,0:13:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Donut Race? Who will win?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.38,0:13:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i told you these lame
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tricks won't work she even sees through
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.82,0:13:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,operation fake gold\Nformidable truly formidable
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.72,0:13:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now i have a question for her what is
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it like to go through\Nlife so dated piss off
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.88,0:13:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's too late for her her heart is cold she\Nhas no soul But the real goal is nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.02,0:13:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not using that dial again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:13:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:14:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Portia and the cutie wagon\Nhave tragically stopped at the fake goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.66,0:14:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.57,0:14:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who won the race?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.62,0:14:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.53,0:14:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did everybody go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The purity of your heart is astounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.60,0:14:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay attention, Portia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been tricked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys are complete idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.24,0:14:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd die of embarrassment\Nif we lost to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.80,0:14:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'd take one of our crew, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.39,0:14:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doll is a complete fake! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.46,0:14:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would do something so evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The barrel tiger is finally\Napproaching the long bamboo cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The goal is just beyond it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.92,0:14:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're in the homestretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.06,0:14:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.26,0:14:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see the finish line. Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.20,0:14:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're catching up to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.92,0:14:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way we'll\Nbeat them at this speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.72,0:14:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.78,0:14:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usak, can you shoot down that bamboo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.44,0:14:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bamboo? All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, more, more! Monja! Capote!\NMove it! Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.80,0:14:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll ram them and sink that stupid\Nboat to the bottom of the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.00,0:15:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.58,0:15:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Capote, you say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.56,0:15:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.50,0:15:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna pay for this!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.77,0:15:13.20,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Cutie Baton!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.50,0:15:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cutie button!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.09,0:15:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of magic flower trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flower!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.87,0:15:19.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Flower Shurikens!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, flowers shitting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.14,0:15:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.05,0:15:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we sprung a lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.28,0:15:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.19,0:15:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.11,0:15:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost to the goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep paddling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.36,0:15:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Round one of the Davy back fight, the\Ndonut race, is about to come to a close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.48,0:15:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mocha. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.22,0:15:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay strong, Monda.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let him beat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.60,0:15:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to lose if\Nwe don't do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.20,0:15:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring us up alongside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.38,0:15:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, my darling, you look so\Nhot when you're going fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, you guys almost\Nwon. What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:16:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're totally going to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.96,0:16:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our boss is coming. Yeah?\NSo what? What can he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.46,0:16:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our boss is just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.24,0:16:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.11,0:16:15.71,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Slow Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.22,0:16:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow, slow beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the winner is the Cutie Wagon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.34,0:16:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hero of the first round of the\NDavy Back Fight is our very own idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.66,0:16:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.58,0:16:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.84,0:16:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.92,0:16:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're about\Nto get a new crew member.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nobody that can\Nbeat the Foxy Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.88,0:16:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We always win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.84,0:16:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hoy, hoy, hoy, hoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.80,0:16:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Befefefefefefe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for you guys to play up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.94,0:17:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are taking one of your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.54,0:17:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everybody OK, Robert?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.28,0:17:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.10,0:17:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck happened out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.04,0:17:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to know the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.88,0:17:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd all like to know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.46,0:17:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did we really lose somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You looked like you were going to win,\Nbut then you suddenly slowed down?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they passed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.08,0:17:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing strange about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.32,0:17:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was caused by slow-mo photon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.06,0:17:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! What did you do to\NNami's team, you smug bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.18,0:17:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a slow-mo photon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are particles unlike any\Nothers known to modern science.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.24,0:17:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever this light touches,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.86,0:17:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be it an animal, a liquid, a solid, or\Neven a gas, will lose a fixed amount
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.38,0:17:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of its velocity, while\Nsimultaneously retaining?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all its other energy. You're dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.34,0:17:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes no sense at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.10,0:17:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just bugged me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.50,0:17:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.98,0:17:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.12,0:17:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something that ridiculous\Nis just — impossible?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.48,0:17:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:18:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you know that such a naive,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,childish claim has no merit\Nout here on these waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.78,0:18:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything they touch slows down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.46,0:18:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the power of Slowmo Photons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.36,0:18:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.84,0:18:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so before?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.48,0:18:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I ate the slow, slow fruit, I became\Na slow motion man, capable of producing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.56,0:18:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these particles from my body. Observe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.48,0:18:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.42,0:18:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A floating cannonball!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.14,0:18:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The slow, slow beam!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.18,0:18:24.80,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Slow Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.96,0:18:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The effect lasts approximately 30 seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.82,0:18:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after which the object will\Nregain its original speed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.18,0:18:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as if nothing had ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.02,0:18:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't believe your eyes, I take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.86,0:18:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.70,0:18:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.96,0:18:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why we didn't win the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.12,0:18:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It also explains why they're so\Noverly confident about these games.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.72,0:18:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a joke of a Devil Fruit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.84,0:18:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.80,0:18:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know all the rules and\Nyou agree to all the terms!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The donut race is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.36,0:18:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we are the winners!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.54,0:19:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, too bad for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.82,0:19:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That concludes round one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.76,0:19:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now we shall commence with\Nthe awarding of the prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.76,0:19:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The winning captain will select\Na member of the opposing crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.16,0:19:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.07,0:19:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My first selection is none other than...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.74,0:19:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, the doctor, Tony Tony Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.46,0:19:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.78,0:19:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring him to me at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.55,0:19:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.47,0:19:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.38,0:19:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.29,0:19:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a rare creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.21,0:19:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're even softer than\NI imagined you'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.14,0:19:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I hold him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.94,0:19:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just so damn cute, and he's ours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.48,0:19:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.32,0:19:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that creep had his\Neyes set on Chopper, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.08,0:19:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose that he is among\Nthe rarest of rare animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.58,0:19:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe he collects cute things?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.16,0:20:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I wouldn't\Nrule out a fur fetish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.18,0:20:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does it even matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.64,0:20:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Focus, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That freak over there\Njust took our friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.94,0:20:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.48,0:20:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.80,0:20:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, enough of all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.34,0:20:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're one of my crew now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.10,0:20:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to pledge your loyalty to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.32,0:20:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you can start by putting on this mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.74,0:20:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry that we lost Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.00,0:20:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.84,0:20:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is truly a rarity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.08,0:20:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here, you're talking reindeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.82,0:20:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.88,0:20:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to get along great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.42,0:20:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.33,0:20:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.54,0:20:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.94,0:20:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.16,0:20:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only went out to sea because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't! No! I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you invited me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:20:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said sail to be one of the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.56,0:21:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't go with them! Please! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.50,0:21:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the ship's doctor\Nof the Straw Hat Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.18,0:21:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doty-doty Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.40,0:21:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.70,0:21:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit your bellyaching, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.82,0:21:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's disgraceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.70,0:21:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.02,0:21:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made the choice to set\Nsail as a pirate. Only you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.74,0:21:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now you have to live with the\Nconsequences of that decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.96,0:21:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We agreed to the terms of this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.60,0:21:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, Usopp, and everyone\Nelse did the best they could.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.26,0:21:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not one pirate worth his salt is\Ngoing to sympathize with those tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.64,0:21:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man would suck it up and quietly\Nwatch the rest of this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.92,0:21:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.44,0:21:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know how he must be feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.00,0:21:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boil me or cook me alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me your worst, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.18,0:21:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:21:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.44,0:22:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that swordsman is totally awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.64,0:22:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, you teach him a lesson, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.64,0:22:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, get Chopper back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.68,0:22:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss, let's take him next.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.52,0:22:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That reindeer's got guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.66,0:22:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get the second round started.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.88,0:22:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So inspirational, I can't stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.58,0:22:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we still have two\Nrounds left of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.96,0:22:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way we're letting these\Njerks take our emergency food supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.40,0:22:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saji, we're counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.68,0:22:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The exchange is complete\Nand the excitement
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.48,0:22:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,explodes as the daily\Nbackbite enters round two.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.26,0:22:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wasn't Chopper supposed\Nto be in the second round?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.96,0:22:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can he compete if they took him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.72,0:22:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.98,0:22:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one of the most\Nthrilling parts of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.32,0:22:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.32,0:22:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cannot change your team's roster.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.24,0:22:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No replacements allowed. In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.80,0:22:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only the remaining two contestants\Ncan participate in round two's game,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.20,0:22:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the groggy ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.34,0:22:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This gives the foxy\Nteam an early advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.58,0:22:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.49,0:22:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.41,0:22:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, you could sit this one out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.88,0:22:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, but feel free to do\Nthe same thing, you loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:22:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe that they're\Ngoing to work together as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.56,0:22:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that? Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.32,0:23:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will now explain the\Nrules of the groggy ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.22,0:23:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a playing field,\Nand we have two goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.66,0:23:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock the ball into the goal, and you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.50,0:23:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the ball isn't actually a ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.00,0:23:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The balls are people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.92,0:23:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both teams must select\Nsomeone to be the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.46,0:23:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make your selection.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.00,0:23:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.04,0:23:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one of you two guys\Nis going to be the ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.08,0:23:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ballmarker.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.02,0:23:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who said you get to pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.60,0:23:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the ball, you moss-headed bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.68,0:23:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.04,0:23:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their entrance theme song.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.38,0:23:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's time to welcome back the\Nundisputed elites of the groggy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.08,0:23:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Race. They are undefeated, unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.42,0:23:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unstoppable yeah crush them the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.32,0:23:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,famous groggy monsters have taken\Nthe field behold the kings of the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.54,0:23:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ring first up is full dash hamburger
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.30,0:23:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,following behind is taco machine
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.10,0:24:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And last but not least, the half-giant,\Nhalf-fish-man himself, Big Pan the Optown!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.96,0:24:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is literally a monstrous march!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.22,0:24:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.86,0:24:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fish-man is ginormous! Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.32,0:24:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one wearing the\Nball marker! Fish-fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.60,0:24:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.34,0:24:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disappointed?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.54,0:24:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all.

